@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template illustration — uncertain external effect and reconciliation
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #64748B
start
:Preserve exact attempt / reviewed intent;
:Record actual bounded observation;
:Check current authority for next action;
if (Observation/reconciliation permitted?) then (no)
 :Retain actual effects and uncertainty;
 :Expose permitted status / owner intervention;
 stop
else (yes)
 :Inspect attributable evidence if facility supports it;
endif
if (Outcome established?) then (yes)
 :Record confirmed / partial / no-effect outcome;
 :Apply operation-specific next-action contract;
 stop
else (no)
 :Retain UNKNOWN outcome;
 :No blind consequential replay;
 :Define explicit authorized intervention;
 stop
endif
@enduml
